cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SexDiffKG in your research, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "SexDiffKG: A Sex-Differential Knowledge Graph for Drug Safety from 14.5 Million FDA Adverse Event Reports"
authors:
  - family-names: Shaik
    given-names: Mohammed Javeed Akhtar Abbas
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-1748-7516"
    email: jshaik@coevolvenetwork.com
    affiliation: "CoEvolve Network, Independent Researcher, Barcelona, Spain"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jshaik369/SexDiffKG"
url: "https://github.com/jshaik369/SexDiffKG"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.18819192"
date-released: "2026-03-08"
version: "4.0"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
keywords:
  - knowledge graph
  - pharmacovigilance
  - sex differences
  - drug safety
  - adverse drug reactions
  - FAERS
abstract: >-
  SexDiffKG links 14,536,008 deduplicated FDA FAERS reports (87 quarters,
  2004Q1-2025Q3), analysed separately for women and men, with drug-target,
  protein-interaction, pathway and gene-expression data. Version 4 contains
  109,867 nodes and 1,822,851 edges (1,532,674 unique). Sex-difference labels
  use an untested log-ratio threshold and are under revision; see
  KNOWN_ISSUES.md in the repository.
